WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.167 --> 00:00:02.869
TATIANA SUAREZ:<i> I believe that
I'm the best in the world.</i>

00:00:02.869 --> 00:00:03.770
COMMENTATOR:
<i> Such a dominant figure.</i>

00:00:04.037 --> 00:00:05.004
COMMENTATOR 2:
<i>Suarez is on another level.</i>

00:00:05.671 --> 00:00:07.606
COMMENTATOR:
<i> I haven't seen this kind
of dominance in a long time.</i>

00:00:07.606 --> 00:00:10.343
SPEAKER:<i> One of the great
 what-ifs in MMA history.</i>

00:00:10.410 --> 00:00:12.178
<i> We all thought, like,
she's gonna be a champion.</i>

00:00:12.612 --> 00:00:17.250
SPEAKER 2:<i> The former
wrestling prodigy returns
after a nearly four-year layoff.</i>

00:00:17.884 --> 00:00:18.818
SPEAKER 3:<i> What's your name?</i>

00:00:19.085 --> 00:00:20.920
Tatiana Suarez.

00:00:21.054 --> 00:00:22.255
♪ (INSPIRATIONAL MUSIC
PLAYING) ♪

00:00:22.322 --> 00:00:23.389
TATIANA:<i> My entire life,</i>

00:00:23.522 --> 00:00:25.692
<i> people told me that
 I shouldn't wrestle</i>

00:00:25.758 --> 00:00:26.559
<i> because I was a girl,</i>

00:00:26.692 --> 00:00:28.494
I shouldn't be there
'cause I was a girl.

00:00:28.794 --> 00:00:30.162
SPEAKER 4: Come on, Tatiana!

00:00:30.529 --> 00:00:33.599
She just... (MIMICS HITTING MAT)
...put these kids to their back.

00:00:33.933 --> 00:00:36.936
Tatiana Suarez
is one of the pioneers,

00:00:37.036 --> 00:00:38.203
<i> I would say,
 of female wrestling.</i>

00:00:38.270 --> 00:00:40.306
That was just kind of
the biggest eye-opener.

00:00:40.373 --> 00:00:42.108
<i>Like, wow, this is really
something that I could do.</i>

00:00:42.642 --> 00:00:45.411
SPEAKER 2:<i> At one point,
 a US Olympic hopeful
 in wrestling,</i>

00:00:45.478 --> 00:00:49.081
<i>those plans were derailed
 with a serious injury</i>

00:00:49.315 --> 00:00:51.684
<i> which revealed something
 much larger than that.</i>

00:00:52.151 --> 00:00:54.253
It ended up being cancerous.

00:00:54.487 --> 00:00:55.488
She kinda...

00:00:57.056 --> 00:00:58.224
went into the dark.

00:01:00.593 --> 00:01:02.762
SPEAKER 5:<i> Over the years,
 you've had a variety
 of injuries.</i>

00:01:03.162 --> 00:01:04.397
SPEAKER:<i> It's a real travesty.</i>

00:01:04.597 --> 00:01:07.600
DANA WHITE:<i> You break your neck,
 you get thyroid cancer,</i>

00:01:07.934 --> 00:01:09.836
<i> then you blow
 your entire knee out.</i>

00:01:10.036 --> 00:01:11.670
Life has thrown a lot at her.

00:01:12.104 --> 00:01:15.174
 TATIANA:<i> I don't think
 I've ever thought about
 giving up on anything,</i>

00:01:15.240 --> 00:01:17.610
but I really felt it.

00:01:19.679 --> 00:01:21.247
<i>I knew that I wasn't done.</i>

00:01:21.647 --> 00:01:24.117
<i> I'm gonna find a way
 to fight again.</i>

00:01:25.084 --> 00:01:27.286
The things
we asked Tatiana to do,

00:01:27.620 --> 00:01:29.788
I don't know many athletes
who could've endured it.

00:01:29.922 --> 00:01:31.090
♪ (INTENSE MUSIC PLAYING) ♪

00:01:31.157 --> 00:01:32.925
TATIANA:<i> I was off
 for a very long time.</i>

00:01:33.125 --> 00:01:34.661
<i>You just think to yourself,
 like,</i>

00:01:34.761 --> 00:01:35.728
<i>"Will I be the same athlete?"</i>

00:01:37.263 --> 00:01:40.132
At this time,
you would be cleared to compete.

00:01:40.833 --> 00:01:43.102
DANA:
<i>She's worked her whole life
 to get here,</i>

00:01:43.202 --> 00:01:44.871
<i>and she's overcome it all.</i>

00:01:45.304 --> 00:01:48.074
COMMENTATOR 3:<i> Tatiana Suarez
 is the Ultimate Fighter!</i>

00:01:48.174 --> 00:01:49.675
TATIANA:<i> The journey makes you
 a better person</i>

00:01:49.742 --> 00:01:52.511
if you use the obstacles
to make you better.

00:01:52.612 --> 00:01:55.114
I'm from a place that says,
"We don't break."

00:01:55.180 --> 00:01:56.315
<i> I've overcome a lot,</i>

00:01:56.449 --> 00:01:58.585
<i> and I'm never gonna stop
 till I'm at the top.</i>

00:01:58.651 --> 00:02:01.387
-♪ (MUSIC BUILDS) ♪
-(CHEERING)

00:02:01.454 --> 00:02:03.590
♪ (MUSIC CONCLUDES) ♪

